- `CopyLinkButton.Model.swift` — pure `CopyLinkButtonLogic` (toast-intent mapping, icon/label switch, copy guard), telemetry seam (P1/S11 `view.opened`), optional toast presenter seam (native `useToast`), i18n facade (P1/S10), `@MainActor @Observable` model.
